VectorGL @PROJECT_VERSION@
System: @CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME@ @CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR@
Compiler: @CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID@ @CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_VERSION@
Configuration: $<CONFIG>
Linkage: static
UI: @VECTORGL_BUILD_UI@
GLFW adapter: @VECTORGL_BUILD_GLFW_ADAPTER@
Native dialogs: @VECTORGL_BUILD_DIALOGS@
FreeType provider: @VECTORGL_FREETYPE_RESOLVED@
Use the same compiler ABI, architecture, configuration and C++ runtime as this SDK.
